nd enjoying the outdoors.\n\n- Convenient parking and beach access.  There are 1000s of parking spots at the Redondo Beach Pier with up to 24 hour metered parking.\n\n\n**Top 5 reasons to ride an e-bike from the Redondo Beach Pier:**\n1.   Ride from Redondo Beach to Santa Monica (and back!) with ease.\n2.   Hop on the beach bike path right from our shop.\n3.   Cruise from one place to the next without worrying about parking.\n4.   Take in the best sights at the beach without the sweaty grind of pedaling a traditional pedal-power bike.\n5.  Feel like a kid again with the joy of riding a bike with pedal assist power.\n\n**E-Bike Rental Includes:**\n\n- Single rider e-bike and front basket\n- Lock and helmet\n- 12 Amp Hour Battery, up to 50 mile range\n- 5 level pedal assist\n- Comfortable cushioned seat\n- Battery charger is included with the overnight and multi-day option.\n- E-Bike Orientation:  We provide a complete tutorial on the e-bike so you'll know how to use all of the features and feel comfortable riding. Riders must adhere to the safety guidelines agreed to in the rental agreement.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "24-Hour E-Bike Rental", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/478898/images/1022376/", "pk": 1022376, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Q52GuMkDSeC5gxy28b1A", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Q52GuMkDSeC5gxy28b1A", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/beachebiking/items/478898/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 366, "width": 2560, "height": 1347, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/8vPrcuOSEKakmrwBJxrQ"}, "cropped_ur